<section class="panel"><h2>Technical appendix</h2><p class="footnote">The report archive stores this exact versioned JSON payload before rendering HTML. Detailed CPU heatmap data, time-series input, sources, exclusions, and charts above are all traceable to that immutable payload; no calculation is performed by this template.</p><h3>All-server evidence</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Host</th><th>Role</th><th>Environment</th><th class="numeric">CPU %</th><th class="numeric">Memory %</th><th class="numeric">Disk %</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.resource_review.all_servers_table %}<tr><td>{{ row.host or row.server or 'Unknown' }}</td><td>{{ row.type or row.role or '—' }}</td><td>{{ row.environment or row.env or '—' }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ row.cpu_used if row.cpu_used is not none else (row.cpu_pct if row.cpu_pct is not none else 'Not emitted') }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ row.mem_used if row.mem_used is not none else (row.mem_pct if row.mem_pct is not none else 'Not emitted') }}</td><td class="numeric">{{ row.disk_used_max if row.disk_used_max is not none else (row.disk_pct if row.disk_pct is not none else 'Not emitted') }}</td><td>{{ row.status or 'Unknown' }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="7" class="muted">No server records were supplied.</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></section>
